1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,378
Quotes scattered across e-mail. Comparisons in spreadsheets.

2
00:00:04,418 --> 00:00:07,708
Decisions nobody can explain. And payment on trust.

3
00:00:08,148 --> 00:00:11,650
VeilProcure turns that into one confidential workflow,

4
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:12,175
on NEAR.

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:16,074
Picture a small studio hiring an accessibility auditor.

6
00:00:16,514 --> 00:00:18,733
It wants competing quotes kept apart,

7
00:00:18,773 --> 00:00:22,396
rules everyone sees up front, and payment only when the work

8
00:00:22,436 --> 00:00:23,190
is delivered.

9
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:26,875
Here is that whole journey, recorded live on NEAR testnet.

10
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,498
Sign in with a one-time e-mail link,

11
00:00:29,538 --> 00:00:33,104
create your organisation, and bind your NEAR wallet with a

12
00:00:33,144 --> 00:00:34,036
signed message.

13
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,932
VeilProcure never holds your keys: every on-chain step is

14
00:00:38,972 --> 00:00:39,809
signed by you.

15
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,568
Describe the work, the deliverables and the budget.

16
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,679
Set hard requirements every quote must pass,

17
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:49,604
and the weights that rank the rest.

18
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,754
Invite suppliers, and set a deadline.

19
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:56,974
Publishing freezes these rules and anchors their hash on NEAR

20
00:00:57,014 --> 00:01:00,310
testnet, so the criteria can't quietly change later.

21
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:04,637
Each supplier gets a private invitation that only their e-mail

22
00:01:04,677 --> 00:01:05,325
can accept.

23
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:08,206
They quote price, delivery and approach,

24
00:01:08,246 --> 00:01:10,497
attach a proposal, and seal the bid:

25
00:01:10,537 --> 00:01:13,998
a salted fingerprint of the quote is recorded on chain.

26
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,493
Until the deadline, the buyer sees nothing,

27
00:01:18,533 --> 00:01:21,187
and competitors can't even open the request.

28
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,058
After the chain-time deadline, the buyer closes bidding.

29
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:30,305
Every opened quote is recomputed against its fingerprint,

30
00:01:30,345 --> 00:01:32,923
so any change since sealing would be detected.

31
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:35,643
That proves integrity, not secrecy:

32
00:01:35,683 --> 00:01:39,449
quotes are encrypted at rest, and the platform holds the key.

33
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:43,590
First, the published rules: ineligible quotes are flagged,

34
00:01:43,630 --> 00:01:46,268
and eligible ones are ranked by the weights.

35
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:49,689
Then, if you ask, a private AI reviews the quotes.

36
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:53,699
Nothing is sent until the model's hardware attestation is

37
00:01:53,739 --> 00:01:57,606
verified through NEAR AI Cloud, and the signed response is

38
00:01:57,646 --> 00:01:58,818
checked on return.

39
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:04,574
The notes are advisory: the AI cannot award or move money.

40
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:08,829
The buyer awards the top quote and funds the escrow with

41
00:02:08,869 --> 00:02:11,387
exactly that amount: 1.2 testnet NEAR,

42
00:02:11,427 --> 00:02:12,868
from their own wallet.

43
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:19,377
The contract now holds the funds. It can only pay the awarded

44
00:02:19,417 --> 00:02:21,692
supplier, or return them to the buyer.

45
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:27,578
The supplier accepts, delivers, and anchors evidence of the

46
00:02:27,618 --> 00:02:27,859
work.

47
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:36,642
The buyer approves, and the contract pays the supplier:

48
00:02:36,682 --> 00:02:40,093
a real transaction anyone can verify on NEAR testnet.

49
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:44,940
A release by anyone else, or a second payout,

50
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:47,180
is rejected by the contract itself.

51
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:50,261
And every step lands in a hash-chained audit trail.

52
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:55,582
VeilProcure. Private bids. Intelligent decisions.

53
00:02:55,622 --> 00:02:57,481
Payments under your control.
